## Domain Model

### Entities

| Entity        | Key Fields                                                  |
|---------------|-------------------------------------------------------------|
| `User`        | email, role (ADMIN/RECRUITER/INTERVIEWER), first/last name  |
| `Candidate`   | name, email, phone, resume_url, desired_position, status    |
| `Vacancy`     | title, department, description, recruiter_id, is_open       |
| `Interview`   | candidate_id, recruiter_id, interviewer_id, scheduled_at, score, comment |
| `CandidateStatusHistory` | candidate_id, from_status, to_status, changed_by_id, changed_at |

### Status Machine

```
NEW ──→ SCREENING ──→ INTERVIEW ──→ OFFER ──→ HIRED
 │           │              │          │
 └───────────┴──────────────┴──────────┴──→ REJECTED (terminal)
                                              HIRED (terminal)
```

Transitions are enforced by `ALLOWED_TRANSITIONS` dict in `apps/candidates/enums.py`.
Every transition is recorded in `CandidateStatusHistory`.

